#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink-high-latency.rst:5
#: 04f4729544a34ef287509d9d23702634 19420697a8a54e7c8e97a54a4305728a
#: 2ca7bf147e434727a0ee99235bdcc233 34236a09987047a0b706db5538144acd
#: 91f0217bf86c4b48ad3ccbc4737524a1 e1545fb93bda44e097775bfddbb64816
msgid "MAVLink High Latency Mode"
msgstr "MAVLink 高延迟模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink-high-latency.rst:7
#: 0a0fc4fec45c4e90888945da3cb2ed06 624a6c091d0a4a7c9e1eeeac8a2c7a7f
#: 63acc79482174065a79468f4c9479838 76ea2a2aec5847649ced222c568c130b
#: e6c472a0b6344d5aa38916e106feb6eb f2d6a8eb04a742008261f75040d8dafd
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports the `MAVLink High Latency "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/high_latency.html>`__ protocol. This "
"designed for very low bandwidth or high cost links, such as satellite or "
"LoRA."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持 `MAVLink 高延迟 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/high_latency.html>`__ "
"协议。该协议专为极低带宽或高成本链路设计，例如卫星或 LoRA。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink-high-latency.rst:9
#: 0e5e1bebc3644954a2abca0406676aba 1ac7798a20aa400bb2c8096bd9a26f5c
#: 27c5d05c2f73454fb5b36042cbee3de8 2bae7b663dbd46c3a205a8225fa90818
#: 7f1f4de6866b463f86dc802bd16ba31f 993e1f6c724b4888bfdccac91c8867d9
msgid ""
"Within this protocol, only the `HIGH_LATENCY2 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HIGH_LATENCY2>`__ MAVLink "
"message is sent once per 5 seconds. Any responses to MAVLink commands or "
"requests (such as command acknowledgements or parameter requests) will be "
"sent too."
msgstr ""
"在该协议中，仅 `HIGH_LATENCY2 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HIGH_LATENCY2>`__ MAVLink 消息每 5 "
"秒发送一次。MAVLink 命令或请求的任何响应（如命令确认或参数请求）也会发送。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink-high-latency.rst:11
#: 1a12e0dde1ec47cd99c43242e4def756 456c152d53804ee697d67928d6de40f6
#: 84d0cd67f5524f4abc824268c9301234 c4d1f460876c4eebb2b09c65d8a87498
#: d2a7baf7ba094df1bc6e767fa582d6d9 f3cea8a5375e40f597f60a3341d3f42e
msgid ""
"MAVLink High Latency is available as an option on any telemetry port. A "
"typical use case is to have a standard MAVLink telemetry port for initial "
"configuration and system checkout - usually a radio modem or 4G link. A low-"
"bandwidth modem will be connected on a 2nd telemetry port, which the user "
"can activate"
msgstr ""
"MAVLink 高延迟模式可在任何数传端口上作为选项使用。典型使用场景是：用一个标准 MAVLink "
"数传端口进行初始配置和系统检查（通常为无线电调制解调器或 4G 链路），再在第二个数传端口上连接低带宽调制解调器，由用户按需启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink-high-latency.rst:14
#: 1fc37fe1f788461d9325819f68fbc0ec 315d37fc960a46d5b22a20bde1391a9e
#: 5229282a11b0417cb0ccc8422cc8ae64 5877c3b038f743789158200f1c240122
#: 777ac5b824004569be15f189cd546f8a 9ffbe65edab2457fb846e5dfe05f016a
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink-high-latency.rst:16
#: 42c22ac2d3ff4e9fbbd018382167ab28 9a235af9a22f41ba96dc1d3bbb195c58
#: 9edc16bd298842b3950ace93014893be a92983a434434cbf95de22930e00be57
#: a9bd2f93b09c4ea7b013f6c649468836 ff37f9f4ea4142bda155521b8415e872
msgid ""
"Make sure the desired telemetry port protocol is set to option MAVLink High "
"Latency (``SERIALn_PROTOCOL = 43``)"
msgstr "确保目标数传端口协议已设置为 MAVLink 高延迟选项（``SERIALn_PROTOCOL = 43``）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink-high-latency.rst:18
#: 0d807585c27647029c07899bc9a14763 1a343da87f874efdbd680477cd703365
#: 735a6f5882844170b53d36f1f4df8580 d9c42dbae52143db9f266548557a8847
#: e156690fe3a34fe08bdd7e6b66889a98 f91966b3396b4804a5bbbc0edc44b369
msgid ""
"In MAVProxy use the ``link hl on|off`` to enable or disable sending "
"telemetry on the High Latency port"
msgstr "在 MAVProxy 中，使用 ``link hl on|off`` 命令启用或禁用高延迟端口的数传发送"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink-high-latency.rst:20
#: 2001d2f2422a465295a853351b50e5bd 5674db09aeff452092b16df70552524b
#: 7005d8e7a12f40d385b27e8bedbb35ce 79034bdc191b493a8e662688a8d04041
#: 7e0e9b5f04bc4463908b6b07c150af26 adf55f12d4274b5786fedbb31a1bfbb1
msgid ""
"In QGroundControl connect using the ``High Latency`` option to enable "
"sending telemetry on the High Latency port"
msgstr "在 QGroundControl 中，使用 ``High Latency`` 连接选项以启用高延迟端口的数传发送"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink-high-latency.rst:22
#: 0bd50e8f51944e6ca66de15a07dc8964 5431aee9484d4172a8ca02031eb4f11d
#: 975de86b96a9434cb3101109a9eb28a6 bd06fba8f471472c92221e33ea37c672
#: dc06bdc1caca45988ef5f177c37bc630 f7113374de4c40d699a2963c213c01bf
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner, use ``Actions -> Do Action`` to enable or disable "
"sending telemetry on the High Latency port"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中，使用 ``Actions -> Do Action`` 启用或禁用高延迟端口的数传发送"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink-high-latency.rst:25
#: 38d1789dc57f45c6b0fbc37ab3d3c22a 87e6de0b71344a36862fe92ac4e77b3e
#: 99601d68e2ad4e77b91f22d2cf782d47 b71f1ad355c649369d5907dab24d6bfc
#: c8f37cb7fc8b4cb48a5f23d624739fac d0a39e7b40604d1c88f59cd5cc01ff4a
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink-high-latency.rst:27
#: 2cc041c0bc3e42e7b92b66b62aed829a 520082766d714ab7b70a9967d2d6e828
#: 9cfe9f27137548cd99a9a2c3ad9afdfd d63536fb6d1b48ea9e64d480e00595b5
#: f1ffac04dcf94ecd84acba0fc7d0d6ae f77cc36754064033b4f6d44e9d228eab
msgid ""
"MAVLink High Latency will only send very basic, high level information of "
"the vehicle's position and status."
msgstr "MAVLink 高延迟模式仅发送飞行器位置和状态的非常基本的高层信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink-high-latency.rst:29
#: 508e5df7d25448ea958588b958345cf5 8cbaa36b90a343b3ab005fad2797a628
#: b1fc7aff9c7742aab855c98a80981271 d38d5ec9bc8b475695d7ec07b34d0b51
#: e3084c5265ab4e47a410675634b657dd ffff9d7a56f04a29abbc62c72e1068e3
msgid ""
"The bandwidth requirements of MAVLink High Latency are very minimal - less "
"than 100 bytes/sec in most cases."
msgstr "MAVLink 高延迟模式的带宽需求极低——大多数情况下低于 100 字节/秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink-high-latency.rst:31
#: 0e5f2827444846b88397466af6aa9091 2facac09b05d481aa3386acca60da5e4
#: 441bb9911c4241cf99b6347950fa93af 6604458ac9814b0c88731a5bd1b82d53
#: 969e7f9bbd6f4cc78b8dcd511cde2da9 c7e4e453d5484eeba752ac441f32ba42
msgid ""
"The enable/disable of a High Latency link can be sent over any telemetry "
"link and will enable/disable all High Latency links on the vehicle."
msgstr "高延迟链路的启用/禁用可通过任何数传链路发送，并将启用/禁用飞行器上所有高延迟链路。"
